OL,3,ABBC Radio 1's Big Weekend 2027 heads to
OL,4,ABrighton                               
OL,6,FBBC Radio 1's Big Weekend is heading to
OL,7,FBrighton for 2027, it has been         
OL,8,Fannounced.                             
OL,10,FThe annual music festival will take    
OL,11,Fplace in Preston Park from Friday 28 to
OL,12,FSunday 30 May next year.               
OL,14,FRadio 1 Breakfast Show host Greg James 
OL,15,Ftold listeners he is "so excited" to   
OL,16,Fbring the festival to the city as he   
OL,17,Frevealed the news on air, adding: "It's
OL,18,Fgoing to be amazing".                  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
